Package: guatiao.intake
Type: Package
Title: Forms, Paths and the Flat Store for 'guatiao' Values
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: person("jose-pr", email = "jose-pr@coqui.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Takes a value in from a person, through the 'guatiao_intake' C
    library: whether a form fits a schema and how it is laid out, which
    fields are shown, the path grammar ('agent[1].name') and the flat
    key-to-text store a front end keeps, all over values of the 'guatiao'
    package. The library itself is not included: it is opened at run time
    from the path in 'GUATIAO_INTAKE_LIBRARY' or 'GUATIAO_LIBRARY'.
License: MPL-2.0
URL: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao, https://boriken-dev.github.io/guatiao/
BugReports: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2), guatiao (>= 0.0.0.1)
LinkingTo: guatiao
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
